  {
    "id": "jug",
    "name": "Jug",
    "grip": "Wrap the whole hand over the deep lip. Relax your grip: jugs are for resting and clipping.",
    "learn": {
      "mistake": "Over-gripping and pulling on bent arms. Hang on straight arms and shake out: jugs are where you rest.",
      "footUse": "A great foothold: room for your toe, or a heel hook over the lip.",
