  {
    "id": "sloper",
    "name": "Sloper",
    "grip": "No edge to pull: open the hand, maximise skin contact, keep hips low and arms straight.",
    "learn": {
      "mistake": "Pulling with bent arms and high hips. Friction needs your weight below the hold.",
      "footUse": "Smear: press the sole flat on it, heel low, and trust the rubber.",
      "examples": [
        {
          "src": "/learn/sloper-1.webp",
