  {
    "id": "foot-chip",
    "name": "Foot chip",
    "grip": "A tiny chip for your feet, not your hands. Place the tip of your shoe precisely and keep your weight on it.",
    "learn": {
      "mistake": "Looking away while you place your foot. Watch the toe land, then shift your weight onto it.",
      "footUse": "Made for feet: stand on it with the tip of your shoe, heel slightly raised.",
